---
// EN legal content · Regulatory Compliance · copied verbatim from src/pages/en/legal/compliance.astro
export const meta = {
  title: 'Regulatory Compliance · Zymplo',
  description: 'Zymplo regulatory compliance in each country of operation: LGPD · GDPR · CCPA · LFPDPPP · etc.',
  lastUpdated: '2026-11-02',
};
// OPS fix(links): `base` es el prefijo (país o idioma) del contexto donde
// se renderiza este documento — '' en el apex ES, '/en' o '/pt' en el apex
// de idioma, '/{slug}' bajo /[country]/legal/*. Todo link interno "mismo
// contexto, otro documento" tiene que pasar por acá — un valor fijo tipo
// '/legal/...' ignora el contexto y manda siempre al documento en español
// del apex (medido 2026-08-18: br.zymplo.com/legal/privacy/ → lang=es).
export interface Props { base: string }
const { base } = Astro.props;

---
<header>
  <a href="https://zymplo.com/"><img src="/brand/isotipo.svg" alt="Zymplo" /></a>
  <h1>Regulatory Compliance</h1>
  <p class="meta">Last updated: {meta.lastUpdated}</p>
  <p class="meta"><a href="https://zymplo.com/legal/compliance/">Español</a> · <a href="https://zymplo.com/pt/legal/compliance/">Português</a> · English</p>
</header>

<p>Zymplo operates in 13 countries. Here are the data protection and invoicing laws we use as reference in each one.</p>

<h2>1. Corporate structure</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Zymplo Inc.</strong> · Delaware USA · EIN 30-1486305 · DUNS 145007664</li><li><strong>Zymplo Brasil LTDA</strong> · CNPJ 66.667.634/0001-00 · Fortaleza CE · Brazil operating subsidiary</li><li><strong>Zymplo S.A.</strong> · RUC 80170149-0 · San Lorenzo · Paraguay operating company</li><li>Primary banking: Mercury Bank (USA)</li>
  <li>Payment processing: Stripe Atlas (USA) · Stripe Brasil (BR) · Mercado Pago (LATAM)</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. Reference laws by country</h2>
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Country</th><th>Privacy</th><th>Tax / invoicing</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>🇧🇷 Brazil</td><td>LGPD (Lei 13.709/2018) · ANPD</td><td>Municipal NFS-e · MEI · DAS · CPF/CNPJ</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🇲🇽 Mexico</td><td>LFPDPPP · INAI</td><td>RESICO · CFDI · RFC/CURP</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🇺🇸 USA</td><td>CCPA (California) · COPPA · various state laws</td><td>EIN · Sole Prop · LLC · Sched-C</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🇨🇴 Colombia</td><td>Law 1581 / 2012 · SIC</td><td>Régimen Simple (RST) · NIT/Cédula/RUT</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🇪🇸 Spain</td><td>GDPR (EU) · LOPDGDD · AEPD</td><td>Autónomos (RETA) · NIF/NIE/DNI</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🇦🇷 Argentina</td><td>Law 25.326 · AAIP</td><td>Monotributo (A-K) · DNI/CUIT</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🇵🇾 Paraguay</td><td>Law 1682/01 · Law 6534/20 · MITIC</td><td>RIRE · RUC/Cédula · SET</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🇵🇪 Peru</td><td>Law 29733 · ANPD-Peru</td><td>RUS / Nuevo RUS / MYPE · RUC/DNI · SUNAT</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🇪🇨 Ecuador</td><td>Organic Law on Data Protection · SPDP</td><td>RIMPE Emprendedor · RUC/Cédula · SRI</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🇨🇱 Chile</td><td>Law 19.628 · CPLT</td><td>Pro PyME / 14 ter · Chilean RUT · SII</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🇺🇾 Uruguay</td><td>Law 18.331 · URCDP</td><td>Monotributo Social MIDES · RUT/Cédula · DGI</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🇧🇴 Bolivia</td><td>Law 1928 · ATT</td><td>RTS Simplificado · NIT/Cédula · SIN</td></tr>
    <tr><td>🇨🇷 Costa Rica</td><td>Law 8968 · PRODHAB</td><td>Simplified Taxation · Cédula Jurídica · MH</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>3. Providers that process data</h2>
<p>The full list is in the <a href={`${base}/legal/privacy/`}>privacy policy</a> (section 5). In short:</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Meta (WhatsApp Business API):</strong> messaging infrastructure.</li>
  <li><strong>Anthropic, Groq, Deepgram and OpenAI:</strong> AI and voice · they process the content of your messages in real time. We do not use your data to train models.</li>
  <li><strong>Pluggy:</strong> Open Finance in Brazil · only if you connect your bank.</li>
  <li><strong>Stripe / Mercado Pago:</strong> payments · only if you activate payment features.</li>
  <li><strong>Cloudflare · Oracle Cloud Infrastructure:</strong> hosting and CDN.</li>
  <li><strong>Resend:</strong> transactional emails.</li>
  <li><strong>Sentry:</strong> technical error reports.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. International transfers</h2>
<p>Some providers are outside your country, mainly in the United States (e.g. BR user → provider in the USA).</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Basis in Brazil:</strong> the transfer is necessary to provide the service you asked for (LGPD, art. 33, IX, with art. 7, V).</li>
  <li><strong>ANPD standard clauses:</strong> we ask Deepgram, OpenAI and Groq to sign them; with the other providers, this is in preparation.</li>
  <li><strong>Encryption</strong> in transit (HTTPS).</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Data subject rights</h2>
<p>In every country where we operate · users can:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Access their data · request a copy</li>
  <li>Correct inaccurate data</li>
  <li>Delete their account and associated data (<a href={`${base}/legal/delete-account/`}>/legal/delete-account/</a>)</li>
  <li>Portability · export in JSON</li>
  <li>Object to non-essential uses</li>
  <li>Withdraw consent without affecting prior processing</li>
</ul>
<p>Exercise your rights: <a href="mailto:privacy@zymplo.com">privacy@zymplo.com</a> · we respond within 15 days. If you ask us to delete your data, we delete or anonymize it within 15 days, except for what the law requires us to keep (tax receipts: 5 years).</p>

<h2>6. Breach notification</h2>
<p>If a security incident may affect personal data:</p>
<ul>
  <li>We notify the regulatory authority within the legal timeframe of each country (in Brazil, 3 business days: Res. CD/ANPD No. 15/2024).</li>
  <li>We notify affected users via WhatsApp and email where applicable.</li>
</ul>

<h2>7. DPO and regulatory contact</h2>
<ul>
  <li>DPO contact: <a href="mailto:privacy@zymplo.com">privacy@zymplo.com</a></li>
  <li>Legal counsel: <a href="mailto:legal@zymplo.com">legal@zymplo.com</a></li>
</ul>

<h2>8. DMCA · Copyright Designated Agent</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Pursuant to 17 U.S.C. § 512, Zymplo Inc. has registered a DMCA Designated Agent with the U.S. Copyright Office (Registration No. <strong>DMCA-1077888</strong>).</li>
  <li>DMCA Agent · Zymplo Inc. · 131 Continental Dr, Ste 305, Newark, DE 19713-4324, USA · +1 202-771-8788 · <a href="mailto:support@zymplo.com">support@zymplo.com</a></li>
  <li>Takedown notices must include the elements of § 512(c)(3); counter-notifications per § 512(g)(3). Zymplo terminates repeat infringers in appropriate circumstances (§ 512(i)).</li>
</ul>

<footer>
  <p>Zymplo Inc. · Delaware USA · EIN 30-1486305 · DUNS 145007664 · Zymplo Brasil LTDA · CNPJ 66.667.634/0001-00 · Fortaleza CE</p>
  <p><a href="/">Back to zymplo.com</a> · <a href={`${base}/legal/privacy/`}>Privacy</a> · <a href={`${base}/legal/terms/`}>Terms</a> · <a href={`${base}/legal/cookies/`}>Cookies</a> · <a href={`${base}/legal/delete-account/`}>Delete account</a></p>
</footer>
